{"name": "Everything is Crab: The Animal Evolution Roguelite", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;The Animal Evolution Roguelite&amp;quot;\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/f4d8280666801f227724f84407e67491.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a\u00a0<strong>living ecosystem</strong>, 'Everything is Crab' is a <strong>cute, challenging, highly replayable action roguelite</strong>. Make animal inspired <strong>evolutionary choices</strong> to concoct your own unique creature every run, both mechanically and visually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It's <strong>Spore </strong>meets <strong>Modern Roguelites</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing different player evolutions running through grassy, desert, and snowy environments, dodging attacks from different critters. Pop-up menus reveal different Evolution options (applying scales, more mass, or sharpened claws), and bonus activations (the Mud Pond choice letting players select from decreased damage with 'mud bath', increased hot and cold resistance with 'thermoregulate', or increased social stats with 'scent marking').\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.poster.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.webm?t=1787067079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.mp4?t=1787067079\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Beat Carcinisation&amp;quot;\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/859ef9ea2f0284d5756305d9056d567c.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As everybody knows, eventually, every organism ends up evolving into a crab. Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, except for you. Choose your own evolutionary path and strategy to thrive and defeat convergent evolution. Take that, science!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"GIF showing a variety of different player evolutions, with the character gaining horns, tentacles, bat wings, snail cones, scorpion stingers, eyes-on-stalks, and more.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.poster.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"256\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.webm?t=1787067079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Evolve, Adapt, Overcome&amp;quot;\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/56b7b89a5b82b9c4707f4ef2c629599f.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 125 abilities combine to create a plethora of different builds and playstyles: Become a wily trickster, a ferocious predator, a gregarious leader, a nimble nomad, or take on any number of other survival strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Legs! Claws! Pincers! Wings! More Legs! Fur! Tail! Scales!\u00a0Tentacles! I SAID MORE LEGS!!! <br/>Build your formidable, visually awkward chimera or get Darwin'd in the process.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing three different boss characters attacking in a variety of biomes: one a cow/crab hybrid, one an elephant-like creature with a shell on its back, and on a wasp-like creation with crab claws.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.poster.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.webm?t=1787067079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.mp4?t=1787067079\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Features&amp;quot;\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/15439ac1fdec62e9c558930d66abd000.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>125+ evolution based abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless possibilities and visual combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategy-defining evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many viable survival strategies and playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a cow.\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/2b990ccfd94bdf71f1f3d51e3707fdff.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"148\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a sloth.\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/75b4807fbab84baa5cb7591092e59dbe.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"148\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a camel.\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/9434e9c8d62d0b7f4ada9df94d503159.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"148\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A living, thriving ecosystem</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different critters with their own goals and strategies, each of them with several stages of evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four distinct biomes with different rules, climate events, points of interest, flora and fauna</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Night and day cycle\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Idle animation of the Crabtaur boss - a cow/crab hybrid.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"260\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.poster.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"512\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.webm?t=1787067079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A variety of bosses that may (or may not) appear with each run</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Huge meta-progression layer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulties system (if you dare!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genetics (starting Characters), which can be combined to create endless starting character combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge Scenarios to push your adaptation skills to the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More evolutions</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless runs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove your survival skills to unlock Endless runs, ditch the timer, and outlast the apocalypse!\u00a0</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Track your findings, meta-progression and achievements in the Codex</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/c65d8d511265f0086e4320b607fca173.apng?t=1787067079\"/><img alt=\"A bouncing hare.\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/c65d8d511265f0086e4320b607fca173.poster.avif?t=1787067079\" width=\"256\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Have a Crabby day!</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The Animal Evolution Roguelite. Hunt, Flee, Scavenge and Thrive in a living ecosystem. Choose from 125+ Evolutions and Specialisations for unique creature combinations in every run. Adapt to survive the natural curve in order to beat carcinisation... or get Darwin'd trying!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/5dfb7336e99feadf3b4f41bab5049b793afa0208/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1787067079", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Animals", "Character Customization", "Strategy", "Survival", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Odd Dreams Digital", "publishers": "Odd Dreams Digital", "release_date": "May 8, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3526710", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "2 December 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/voRXn-hlY0g", "first_seen": 1764630000.0, "review_rank": 1405}